peed (direct velocity control), position (absolute pointing), stabilization (steady tracking), targeting (guided engagement), and video tracker (automated object tracking using computer vision)."}, "ser.JonGuiDataExtBatStatus" {:id "ser.JonGuiDataExtBatStatus", :name "JonGuiDataExtBatStatus", :package "ser", :source "jon_shared_data_types.proto", :values [{:number 0, :name "JON_GUI_DATA_EXT_BAT_STATUS_UNSPECIFIED"} {:number 1, :name "JON_GUI_DATA_EXT_BAT_STATUS_CHARGING"} {:number 2, :name "JON_GUI_DATA_EXT_BAT_STATUS_DISCHARGING"} {:number 3, :name "JON_GUI_DATA_EXT_BAT_STATUS_BALANCING"}], :description "Represents the operational state of an external battery pack, indicating whether the battery is actively charging, discharging, or performing cell balancing. Displayed in the UI with color-coded indicators and pulsing animations for charging/balancing states."}, "ser.JonGuiDataGpsFixType" {:id "ser.JonGuiDataGpsFixType", :name "JonGuiDataGpsFixType", :package "ser", :source "jon_shared_data_types.proto", :values [{:number 0, :name "JON_GUI_DATA_GPS_FIX_TYPE_UNSPECIFIED"} {:number 1, :name "JON_GUI_DATA_GPS_FIX_TYPE_NONE"} {:number 2, :name "JON_GUI_DATA_GPS_FIX_TYPE_1D"} {:number 3, :name "JON_GUI_DATA_GPS_FIX_TYPE_2D"} {:number 4, :name "JON_GUI_DATA_GPS_FIX_TYPE_3D"} {:number 5, :name "JON_GUI_DATA_GPS_FIX_TYPE_MANUAL"}], :description "Represents the quality and type of GPS positional fix available: No Fix (no satellite lock), 1D Fix (time only), 2D Fix (lat/lon without altitude), 3D Fix (full position with altitude), and Manual Fix (user-provided coordinates). Displayed in UI as \"N/A\", \"TIME\", \"2D\", \"3D\", and \"MAN\"."}, "ser.JonGuiDataCompassCalibrateStatus" {:id "ser.JonGuiDataCompassCalibrateStatus", :name "JonGuiDataCompassCalibrateStatus", :package "ser", :source "jon_shared_data_types.proto", :values [{:number 0, :name "JON_GUI_DATA_COMPASS_CALIBRATE_STATUS_UNSPECIFIED"} {:number 1, :name "JON_GUI_DATA_COMPASS_CALIBRATE_STATUS_NOT_CALIBRATING"} {:number 2, :name "JON_GUI_DATA_COMPASS_CALIBRATE_STATUS_CALIBRATING_SHORT"} {:number 3, :name "JON_GUI_DATA_COMPASS_CALIBRATE_STATUS_CALIBRATING_LONG"} {:number 4, :name "JON_GUI_DATA_COMPASS_CALIBRATE_STATUS_FINISHED"} {:number 5, :name "JON_GUI_DATA_COMPASS_CALIBRATE_STATUS_ERROR"}], :description "Represents the current state of the compass calibration process with five distinct statuses: not calibrating (idle), calibrating short, calibrating long (multi-stage extended calibration), finished (successful completion), and error (calibration failure)."}, "ser.JonGuiDataVideoChannel" {:id "ser.JonGuiDataVideoChannel", :name "JonGuiDataVideoChannel", :package "ser", :source "jon_shared_data_types.proto", :values [{:number 0, :name "JON_GUI_DATA_VIDEO_CHANNEL_UNSPECIFIED"} {:number 1, :name "JON_GUI_DATA_VIDEO_CHANNEL_HEAT"} {:number 2, :name "JON_GUI_DATA_VIDEO_CHANNEL_DAY"}], :description "Specifies the active video source with two primary channels: thermal imaging (HEAT) and visible light (DAY). Used throughout command messages and UI components to route camera control operations and render channel-specific overlays to their respective video pipelines."}, "ser.JonGuiDataFxModeDay" {:id "ser.JonGuiDataFxModeDay", :name "JonGuiDataFxModeDay", :package "ser", :source "jon_shared_data_types.proto", :values [{:number 0, :name "JON_GUI_DATA_FX_MODE_DAY_DEFAULT"} {:number 1, :name "JON_GUI_DATA_FX_MODE_DAY_A"} {:number 2, :name "JON_GUI_DATA_FX_MODE_DAY_B"} {:number 3, :name "JON_GUI_DATA_FX_MODE_DAY_C"} {:number 4, :name "JON_GUI_DATA_FX_MODE_DAY_D"} {:number 5, :name "JON_GUI_DATA_FX_MODE_DAY_E"} {:number 6, :name "JON_GUI_DATA_FX_MODE_DAY_F"}], :description "Represents selectable image processing presets for the day camera that optimize video quality for different environmental conditions. Includes DEFAULT plus six named presets (A-F) corresponding to scenarios like Daytime, Dusk, and Fog with distinct filter and processing algorithms."}, "ser.JonGuiDataAccumulatorStateIdx